# Maven CLI arguments applied to every invocation in this project.
#
# These used to live in the Makefile's MAVEN_ARGS and were pasted into all 16 mvn
# call sites. Maven reads this file itself, so plain `./mvnw` and `mvn` now behave
# the same way the build does, and there is one place to change them.
#
# Deliberately NOT here: -Dsurefire.rerunFailingTestsCount and
# -Dfailsafe.rerunFailingTestsCount. Those are a CI policy, not build hygiene, and
# they mask flaky tests. Keeping them in the Makefile stops them silently changing
# what a developer sees locally. See #207.

--batch-mode
-Dstyle.color=always
-DupdatePolicy=never
-Djava.awt.headless=true
-Daether.connector.resumeDownloads=false
-Daether.connector.basic.threads=1
-Dorg.slf4j.simpleLogger.log.org.apache.maven.cli.transfer.Slf4jMavenTransferListener=warn
-DvaadinJavaMaxMemory=2g
-DmaxCpus=8
-Djdk.util.zip.disableZip64ExtraFieldValidation=true
-Dmaven.wagon.http.retryHandler.count=3
